{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T16:54:09+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-28T16:54:09+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Attendo AB (publ)","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Care Facilities","country":"Sweden","city":"Danderyd","website":"https://www.attendo.com","employees":33000,"summary":"Attendo AB (publ) provides health and care services in Scandinavia and Finland. The company offers nursing homes for people with dementia or somatic care requirements; home care services, including care, meals, cleaning, laundry, evening and night, and home health care services; and homes for people of various ages with a range of disabilities or care needs. It also provides day care, respite care and companion, meal and staffing services, as well as short term accommodation; personalized residential care for people with neuropsychiatric and psychosocial disorders; and runs family homes, crisis and emergency homes, HVB homes, dependency care, schools, and various forms of supportive housing. The company was founded in 1985 and is headquartered in Danderyd, Sweden.","exchange":"Stockholm","currency":"SEK","financial_currency":"SEK","summary_fr":"Attento AB (publ) fournit des services de santé et de soins en Scandinavie et en Finlande. La société offre des maisons de soins infirmiers pour les personnes atteintes de démence ou les besoins de soins somatiques; services de soins à domicile, y compris les soins, les repas, le nettoyage, la lessive, le soir et la nuit, et les services de soins de santé à domicile; et les maisons pour les personnes de divers âges avec une gamme de handicaps ou de besoins de soins. Il fournit également des services de soins de jour, de soins de relève et d'accompagnement, de repas et de personnel, ainsi que des logements à court terme; des soins résidentiels personnalisés pour les personnes atteintes de troubles neuropsychiatriques et psycho